91f6d0e1: ;
 .;This routine contains subroutines which are called by FileMan input
 .;templates.
 .;
 .;The routine calls are coded as instruction vectors which in turn
 .;execute code in other routines like DDS or DIR.
 .;
 .;The coding vectors are of the form DDS4^DDS38(Input parameters).
 .;If the routine is not coded as a vector, it must be self-contained
 .;and will be called directly from the FileMan input template.
 .;
